#### Code Spell Checker languages and variants

| Code | Language (variant) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **nl** | Dutch |
| **en-US** | English (American) |
| **en-AU** | English (Australian) |
| **en-GB** | English (British) |
| **en-CA** | English (Canadian) |
| **en** | English (generic; defaults to US English) |
| **fr** | French |
| **fr-FR** | French (France) |
| **de** | German |
| **de-AT** | German (Austrian) |
| **id** | Indonesian |
| **fa** | Persian |
| **pl** | Polish |
| **pt** | Portuguese |
| **pt-BR** | Portuguese (Brazilian) |
| **ru** | Russian |
| **es** | Spanish |
| **tr** | Turkish |
| **uk** | Ukrainian |
| **vi** | Vietnamese |

